  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/SoparBallHouseCafeDissabte24.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 693px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(64 fotos de las tres ediciones anteriores) House Cafe, en la calle Comare Elisa Meseguer, 2 de Onda, programa nuevamente para el pr&oacute;ximo s&aacute;bado 24 de marzo por la noche&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">cena, a partir de las 21 horas, y&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">baile posterior con bachatas, salsa, merengue, cha cha cha, foxtrot, cumbia, sevillanas, tango o rock. Las reservas se pueden realizar en los tel&eacute;fonos 964 63 93 45 &oacute; 600 66 93 69.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsiballsalhousecafe/img_8720.jpg\" alt=\"img_8720\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsiballsalhousecafe/img_8722.jpg\" alt=\"img_8722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsiballsalhousecafe/img_8724.jpg\" alt=\"img_8724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsiballsalhousecafe/img_8725.jpg\" alt=\"img_8725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsiballsalhousecafe/img_8726.jpg\" alt=\"img_8726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsiballsalhousecafe/img_8728.jpg\" alt=\"img_8728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparsiballsalhou